A. Commit message:
batman-adv: Backport ELP metric worker removal and throughput calculation changes

B. Change summary:
This patch backports the removal of the unmanaged ELP metric worker and updates the throughput calculation logic to the older version. The per-interface neighbor metric worker is replaced with a mechanism that handles everything in the interface worker, ensuring that RCU list iteration conflicts are avoided. Additionally, the throughput calculation function has been updated to match the newer version's behavior.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium

